config HISI_IVP
	bool "Hisilicon IVP NPU support"
	depends on ARCH_HISI || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on IOMMU_API
	depends on ARM64
	help
	  Support for the Hisilicon IVP DSP/NPU found on Kirin 970.
	  This provides the platform, SMMU, IPC and character-device
	  interfaces. The firmware and userspace runtime are still
	  required for actual inference.
